{
  "description": [
    "ctadl query model for the TaintBench `fakeappstore` app. Sources and sinks are derived",
    "from the framework methods named in the source/sink IR (Jimple) signatures of",
    "fakeappstore_findings.json: ContentResolver.query() reads the contacts,",
    "HttpEntity.getContent() reads the C2 server's reply (the premium number and message to",
    "send), and TelephonyManager.getDeviceId() reads the IMEI (sources);",
    "SmsManager.sendTextMessage() sends the premium-rate SMS and HttpClient.execute()",
    "uploads to the C2 server (sinks). The findings name the `HttpClient` interface at one",
    "call site, so that is the class the generator matches.",
    "The `propagation` models summarize the apache-http request plumbing the leaked data",
    "travels through -- BasicNameValuePair, UrlEncodedFormEntity/StringEntity,",
    "HttpPost.<init> and HttpPost.setEntity all forward their argument into the object they",
    "build. None of those classes has a body in the APK, so without a summary the taint stops",
    "before it reaches `execute`. `ctadl index` consumes these (they become function",
    "summaries) and `ctadl query` the sources and sinks; xtask passes this file to both.",
    "The last two propagations carry the server's reply along the first half of finding #2:",
    "the response bytes are accumulated in a ByteArrayOutputStream and its toString() is",
    "parsed by a JSONTokener before the message is read back out of the JSON. That flow, and",
    "finding #3, still stop at an AsyncTask boundary (the data is packed into the String[]",
    "passed to execute() and read back out of `params` in doInBackground, or returned",
    "through onPostExecute), which needs a framework callback bridge rather than a model.",
    "ctadl ignores the non-schema `description` key, as it does `expected_lines` in the",
    "nightly models."
  ],
  "model_generators": [
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "query",
          "parent": "Landroid/content/ContentResolver;"
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "sources": [
          {
            "kind": "ContactData",
            "port": "Return"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "getContent",
          "parent": "Lorg/apache/http/HttpEntity;"
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "sources": [
          {
            "kind": "NetworkData",
            "port": "Return"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "getDeviceId",
          "parent": "Landroid/telephony/TelephonyManager;"
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "sources": [
          {
            "kind": "DeviceId",
            "port": "Return"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "sendTextMessage",
          "parent": "Landroid/telephony/SmsManager;"
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "sinks": [
          {
            "kind": "Exfiltration",
            "port": "Argument(*)"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "execute",
          "parent": "Lorg/apache/http/client/HttpClient;"
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "sinks": [
          {
            "kind": "Exfiltration",
            "port": "Argument(*)"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "<init>",
          "parents": [
            "Lorg/apache/http/message/BasicNameValuePair;"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "propagation": [
          {
            "input": "Argument(1)",
            "output": "Argument(0)"
          },
          {
            "input": "Argument(2)",
            "output": "Argument(0)"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "<init>",
          "parents": [
            "Lorg/apache/http/client/entity/UrlEncodedFormEntity;",
            "Lorg/apache/http/entity/StringEntity;",
            "Lorg/apache/http/client/methods/HttpPost;",
            "Lorg/apache/http/client/methods/HttpGet;"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "propagation": [
          {
            "input": "Argument(1)",
            "output": "Argument(0)"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "setEntity",
          "parents": [
            "Lorg/apache/http/client/methods/HttpPost;",
            "Lorg/apache/http/client/methods/HttpEntityEnclosingRequestBase;",
            "Lorg/apache/http/HttpEntityEnclosingRequest;"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "propagation": [
          {
            "input": "Argument(1)",
            "output": "Argument(0)"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "toString",
          "parents": [
            "Ljava/io/ByteArrayOutputStream;"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "propagation": [
          {
            "input": "Argument(0)",
            "output": "Return"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "names": [
            "<init>",
            "nextValue"
          ],
          "parents": [
            "Lorg/json/JSONTokener;"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "propagation": [
          {
            "input": "Argument(1)",
            "output": "Argument(0)"
          },
          {
            "input": "Argument(0)",
            "output": "Return"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
